## 📋 Quick Launch Checklist

```
□ Get Gemini API key (free at aistudio.google.com)
□ Push code to GitHub
□ Deploy to Vercel (free)
□ Add GEMINI_API_KEY in Vercel dashboard
□ Test humanizer and detector on live URL
□ Create /privacy and /terms pages
□ Apply for Google AdSense
□ Share on Reddit, Twitter, Product Hunt
□ Wait for AdSense approval (2–14 days)
□ Replace ad placeholders with real AdSense code
□ Start earning 💰
```

---

> [!TIP]
> Your biggest asset is that this tool is **free and instant** — no signup, no API key. That's what makes it go viral. Focus on getting your first 500 users through social media before worrying about monetization.
